@ApiGateway_HostAddress = http://localhost:5000
@authToken = eyJhbGciOiJSUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.e30.placeholder
@userId = 11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111

### 0. API Gateway Root Status
GET {{ApiGateway_HostAddress}}/
Accept: application/json

###

### 1. API Gateway Health Check
GET {{ApiGateway_HostAddress}}/health
Accept: application/json

###

### 2. AuthenticationService — User Login (Public Route)
POST {{ApiGateway_HostAddress}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "user@example.com",
  "password": "Password123!"
}

###

### 3. FitnessCalculationService — Get Metabolic Metrics (Routed to FCE)
GET {{ApiGateway_HostAddress}}/api/v1/fitness/metrics/{{userId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: application/json

###

### 4. FitnessCalculationService — Get Plan Config by ID
GET {{ApiGateway_HostAddress}}/api/v1/fitness/plans/LW-N
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: application/json

###

### 5. NutritionService — Get Meal Recommendations (Routed to Nutrition)
GET {{ApiGateway_HostAddress}}/api/v1/nutrition/recommendations
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: application/json

###

### 6. ProgressTrackingService — Get User Progress
GET {{ApiGateway_HostAddress}}/api/v1/progress/{{userId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: application/json

###

### 7. UserProfileService — Get User Profile (Routed to Profiles)
GET {{ApiGateway_HostAddress}}/api/v1/profiles
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: application/json

###

### 8. UserProfileService — Get User Settings
GET {{ApiGateway_HostAddress}}/api/v1/settings
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: application/json

###

### 9. WorkoutService — Get Workouts (Routed to WorkoutService)
GET {{ApiGateway_HostAddress}}/api/v1/workouts
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: application/json

###

### 10. WorkoutService — Get Exercises
GET {{ApiGateway_HostAddress}}/api/v1/exercises
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: application/json

###

### 11. WorkoutService — Get Workout Sessions
GET {{ApiGateway_HostAddress}}/api/v1/sessions
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: application/json

###

### 12. WorkoutService — Get Workout Plans
GET {{ApiGateway_HostAddress}}/api/v1/workout-plans
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: application/json

